> "Workplace risk clearance is granted if a personnel member **maintains corporate security clearance** **or** **completes 100 annual training hours**."

This translates to two alternative groups of conditions:
1. The person **maintains corporate security clearance**.
2. The person **completes 100 annual training hours**.

